{:edb/db-before-t 2404 :edb/db-after-t 2405 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535717 50 #inst "2026-10-09T05:51:40.224Z" 13194139535717 true] [17592186096587 1020 #edb/ref 17592186363042 13194139535717 true] [17592186096588 1020 #edb/ref 17592186363045 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1017 #edb/ref 17592186363043 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1089 "q-348756" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14069699/assets/77004c9040818fbc254b9564b9c5821536ef65fcc77f6765b56d2e8524c24ed4.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y=6{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+2{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+1,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}$ and $x=0,$ as shown above. Do not round the answer\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1113 #uuid "f3844a42-8aa0-5eb9-a1d0-267d67a2e8ec" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363042 1145 "The area of the region is given by\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-3\\pi /2}^{0}(6{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+2{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+1)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nRecall  ${cos}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x=1,$ so we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+2{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+1 & =4{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+2({sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3}))+1 \\\\  & =4{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡x$ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n2{cos}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1.\n$$\n\nHence, the area of the region is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-3\\pi /2}^{0}(4{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{x}{3})+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3\\pi /2}^{0}(2(cos\\,(\\frac{2x}{3})+1)+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-3\\pi /2}^{0}(2cos\\,(\\frac{2x}{3})+5)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(3sin\\,(\\frac{2x}{3})+5x)\\,|}_{-3\\pi /2}^{0} \\\\  & =(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡0+5\\cdot 0)-(3sin\\,(\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot (-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}))+5(-\\frac{3\\pi }{2})) \\\\  & =(0+0)-(3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\pi )-\\frac{15\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =(0)-(0-\\frac{15\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{15\\pi }{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363043 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363044 13194139535717 true] [17592186363043 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535717 true] [17592186363043 1041 "field-1" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363043 1104 #edb/ref 17592186363044 13194139535717 true] [17592186363043 1110 #uuid "ac414bdb-1e9c-501d-94fc-5ad66fcd3a37" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363044 1034 "\\frac{15\\pi}{2}" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363044 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535717 true] [17592186363044 1111 #uuid "61404ce4-ecb2-5ab7-bff5-3dc72be79709" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1017 #edb/ref 17592186363046 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1089 "q-348844" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{3\\pi }^{6\\pi }6{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1113 #uuid "889fb234-aee7-55cc-940a-a33b6448e53f" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363045 1145 "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =1-2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =\\frac{x}{6},$ we have\n\n$$\n1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{3})=2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{6}).\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{3\\pi }^{6\\pi }6{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{3\\pi }^{6\\pi }2{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{3\\pi }^{6\\pi }[1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{x}{3})]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{[x-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{x}{3})]}_{3\\pi }^{6\\pi } \\\\  & =3[6\\pi -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{6\\pi }{3})-(3\\pi -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{3}))] \\\\  & =3[6\\pi -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )-(3\\pi -3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi ))] \\\\  & =3(6\\pi -3\\pi ) \\\\  & =9\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363046 1000 #edb/ref 17592186363047 13194139535717 true] [17592186363046 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535717 true] [17592186363046 1041 "field-1" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363046 1104 #edb/ref 17592186363047 13194139535717 true] [17592186363046 1110 #uuid "09c11847-188c-5fd0-96e8-0d9bd3c0d3da" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363047 1034 "9\\pi" 13194139535717 true] [17592186363047 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535717 true] [17592186363047 1111 #uuid "70727f01-13ef-5922-aecb-158776ec5560" 13194139535717 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-348756" 17592186363042 "q-348756/field-1" 17592186363043 "q-348756/field-1/074131e71753d30c82ed90c556f57c3329d4ace9bd4331e7a888efe975b52fc4" 17592186363044 "q-348844" 17592186363045 "q-348844/field-1" 17592186363046 "q-348844/field-1/04cd542765aba14d4b5f4ba166a29e4f0bd2dccc67d5efe801a574e2c14cf8cb" 17592186363047} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
